==English==

===Etymology===
From [[trouble]] + [[make]] + [[-er]]

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-troublemaker.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Alternative forms===
* [[trouble-maker]]
* [[trouble maker]] {{qualifier|proscribed}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# One who [[cause]]s [[trouble]], especially one who does so [[deliberately]].
# A [[complainer]].

====Synonyms====
* [[hooligan]]
* [[stirrer]]
* See also [[Wikisaurus:troublemaker]]
* See also [[Wikisaurus:complainer]]

